      "content": "but it doesn't feel like healing. it just feels like a treadmill. i do the work, i stay clean for a bit, and then i just... fail. it's the same pattern every single time and it's so draining. sometimes i just wonder if i'm even meant to be able to do this. like maybe this is just who i am and i'll never actually change. it just feels so hopeless.",
